# symbolic algebra: polynomials, rational functions, integration, solve
# (src/poly.c, alg.c, rint.c, solve.c); every result is checked

# expand, factor, collect
expand (x+1)^5
expand (x+y+z)^3
factor x^4 - 1
factor x^6 - 1
factor 6x^2 - 5x - 6
factor x^5 + x + 1
factor x^4 + 1
factor x^3 + y^3
factor 4x^2 - 9y^2
factor x^2 y + x y^2
factor 2x^3 + 4x^2 + 2x
collect x^2 y + x y + x^2 + 3, x

# rational functions: cancel, together, apart (with the condition where a
# factor was cancelled)
simplify (x^2-1)/(x-1)
cancel (x^2 - y^2)/(x - y)
together 1/x + 1/(x+1)
together a/b + c/d
apart 1/(x^2-1)
apart (2x+3)/(x^3-x)
apart (x^3+1)/(x^2+1)^2

# simplification rules (each with its condition)
simplify sqrt(x^2)
simplify sqrt(4x^2+4x+1)
simplify exp(log(x))
simplify exp(x)*exp(2x)
simplify x^2/x^3

# gcd, lcm, resultant, discriminant, division
gcd x^2-1, x^2+2x+1
lcm x^2-1, x^2+2x+1
gcd 12, 18
resultant x^2-2, x^2-3x+2
resultant x^2 + y^2 - 1, x - y in y
discriminant a x^2 + b x + c
discriminant x^3 - 3x + 1
quo x^3 + 1, x + 2
rem x^3 + 1, x + 2
divide x^4 + 1 by x^2 + x
substitute x = 2, y = 3 in x^2 + y

# integration of rational functions: complete
integrate 1/(x^3+1)
integrate (x+1)/(x^2+2x+5)
integrate 1/(x^4+1)
integrate x^3/(x^2+1)^2
integrate 1/(x^2+1)^3
integrate 1/(x^2-2)
integrate (x^5+1)/(x^2-1)^2
integrate 1/(x^4-2)
integrate 1/(x^3-2)
integrate 1/(x^4+1) from 0 to 1

# other methods, each differentiated back
integrate 2x*cos(x^2)
integrate exp(x)*sin(x)
integrate x*atan(x)
integrate atan(x)
integrate log(x)^2
integrate asin(x)
integrate sin(x)^3*cos(x)^2
integrate sin(x)^2*cos(x)^2
integrate tan(x)^3
integrate x*cos(x)^2
integrate 1/(1+exp(x))
integrate cosh(x)^2
integrate sqrt(1-x^2)
integrate sqrt(x^2+1)
integrate x^3*sqrt(1+x^2)
integrate 1/(x*sqrt(x^2+1))
integrate x*sqrt(x+1)
integrate log(x)/x
integrate x*exp(x) + 1/(x^3+1)
# a Weierstrass antiderivative jumps at x = pi: the jump is taken out
integrate 1/(2+cos(x)) from 0 to 2pi

# solve
solve x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0
solve (x-1)^2 = 0
solve x^2 + 1 = 0
solve x^3 - 3x + 1 = 0
solve x^3 - 2 = 0
solve x^4 - 10x^2 + 1 = 0
solve x^5 - x - 1 = 0
solve (x^2-1)/(x-1) = 0
solve a x^2 + b x + c = 0 for x
solve sin x = 1/2
solve 2 sin(3x + 1) = 1
solve cos(2x) = 0
solve sin(x)^2 - sin(x) = 0
solve exp(x) = 5
solve 2^x = 8
solve log(x) = 2
solve exp(x^2) = 3
solve sin(x) = 2
solve x + y = 3, x - y = 1
solve x + y = 3, 2x + 2y = 6
solve x + y = 1, x + y = 2
solve x^2 + y^2 = 1, y = x

# English
factor x^4 - 1
expand (x+1)^5
simplify (x^2-1)/(x-1)
partial fraction decomposition of 1/(x^2-1)
decompose 1/(x^2-4) into partial fractions
put 1/x + 1/(x+1) over a common denominator
solve x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0
solve sin x = 1/2
solve the system x + y = 3, x - y = 1
gcd of x^2-1 and x^2+2x+1
the discriminant of a x^2 + b x + c
what is the remainder when x^3 + 1 is divided by x + 2?
plug in x = 2 into x^2 + 1
what is the integral of 1/(x^3 + 1)?
